==Strategy==
This stage of this advent is similar to the last stage except that this one has more threatening peons. The 2 most problematic peons in this stage are the Scissoroos and Chickful As as they have high enough range to hide behind the Tyrant and push hard.  To make up for the increased difficulty, there are Celeboodles that come out periodically and give a steady supply of money which means money won't be a major issue in this stage.

The stage only has a few waves of peons; so after the difficult peons stop coming out you will be able to easily stall out the Tyrant until you win. To achieve this you must make sure to not let too many enemies stack behind the Infernal Tyrant. Using cats such as: [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling]], [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]], and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] should allow the peons hiding behind the Tyrant to be hit which will make sure they don't stack up. Additionally, as per all stages in this advent, make sure to bring [[Pogo Cat (Rare Cat)|Jiangshi Cat]] and another meatshield of your choice to stall the Tyrant effectively. It is also recommended to bring either [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] or [[Talents|Talented]] [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] to get [[Double Bounty]] off the Celeboodles. [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] can also be useful as his wave can hit many enemies but be mindful of his slow speed which could cause him to be hit by the Tyrant before he makes it to the frontlines.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Kasa Jizo (Uber Rare Cat)|Kasa Jizo]]: A great spammable attacker who shreds the Angel peons found in the stage while providing extra attacking power against all the other peons in the stage.
*[[The Grateful Crane (Uber Rare Cat)|Supernova Cosmo]]: Cosmo stands in the Tyrant's blindspot making him a great option for doing big damage to both peons and the Tyrant himself.
*[[Goddess of Light Sirius (Uber Rare Cat)|Goddess of Sunrise Sirius]]: She can stand within the first blindspot and do massive damage to the Angel and Alien peons.
*[[Empress Chronos (Uber Rare Cat)|Almighty Chronos]]: Her [[Freeze]] can heavily slow down the pushing power of the peons and even the Infernal Tyrant as well.

